qsf_test.qsf was generated by tests/m3/fixtures/gen_qsf_test.py (row I704): an original QSF whose hand-assembled Z80 program
plays a 64 sample sine on QSound voice 0 and steps through four pitches (6 s plus 1 s fade). Original to this project and
released as CC0. No Capcom code or sample data is used (a real QSF carries the game's sound ROMs and is not redistributable).
